    },
    {
      "text": "法术升级必须与稀有遗物的被动效果互相咬合",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Becoming powerful requires you to synergise your spells by carefully choosing upgrades and collecting rare relics that offer passive effects to be combined with your finest abilities.",
